WEBVTT

00:00.120 --> 00:05.640
But now military command is not in my hands I have three hundred brothers under me.

00:05.720 --> 00:07.080
Willing to die.

00:08.600 --> 00:13.240
Under me also over a hundred men together.

00:14.840 --> 00:20.520
At most only about five hundred five hundred it is five hundred men strike first.

00:20.800 --> 00:25.320
As long as we control Chen Ying and the main camp then everything will be fine.

00:25.600 --> 00:30.640
Beishuo Army was built by Your Highness if it really comes to fighting we'll definitely put Your Highness first.

00:31.280 --> 00:33.160
Willing to die for Your Highness.

